                "name": "Tail Attack",
                "category": "legendary_actions",
                "text": "Lhammaruntosz makes a tail attack."
            },
            {
                "id": "wing-attack",
                "name": "Wing Attack",
                "category": "legendary_actions",
                "text": "Lhammaruntosz beats its wings. Each creature within 10 feet of Lhammaruntosz must succeed on a DC 20 Dexterity saving throw or take 14 (2d6 + 7) bludgeoning damage and be knocked prone. Lhammaruntosz can then fly up to half her flying speed.",
